Z||000019||elfiero||07-27-2000||04:15 PM||||your looking at about:<BR>1. engine-used $5,000to8,000<BR>2. a-dapter kit$2,500(plate&mounts)<BR>3. PCM$harness$1,500<BR>4. flywheel$500<BR>So,your minium total will be$10,000 for a <BR>first class job.<BR>My advice is put in a standard SBC it works<BR>good and the bugs have been worked out of the<BR>swap.Besides,you will not find a good used<BR>engine for at least 2years-all that are in<BR>the yards now have been hit hard or burned-<BR>that's what it takes to total a 35,000+<BR>car!<BR>||||reg||12
