Z||000024||1FieroGTRacingInc||07-27-2000||08:29 PM||||To ALL INCLUDING Mr.Archie.....<P>I WAS NOT trying to start ANYTHING by my post. I was just pointing out that the cutting and the kit fitting inside the engine compartment. I personally did'nt even think anything about the last coment made by Mr. Archie.... I know that he is an , nevermind... I just thought that the comment  was part of his personality... I DID NOT ,REPEAT, DID NOT WANT TO START ANYTHING... I APOLOGISE TO ALL THE FORUM MEMBER'S,INCLUDING Mr. Archie... I'm Sorry!!!<P>                 Steve  85GT,87GT,842m4 <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
